  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The following table includes data about four planets:</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Planet</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td><strong>Mass</strong></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Radius</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Escape speed</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><strong><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{A}\"></span></strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2v\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><strong><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{B}\"></span></strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2R\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2v\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><strong><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{C}\"></span></strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2R\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><strong><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{D}\"></span></strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4R\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>What is correct about the relationship between the masses of the planets?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{B}&gt;M_{D}=M_{C}&gt;M_{A}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{A}&gt;M_{C}=M_{D}&gt;M_{B}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{C}&gt;M_{A}=M_{D}&gt;M_{B}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M_{B}&gt;M_{A}=M_{D}&gt;M_{C}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
